/1993/28/section/41">41.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1993/28/section/41"> Right of qualifying tenant to obtain information about superior interests etc.</a></span></p></li></ol></li><li class="LegClearFix LegContentsPblock"><p class="LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1993/28/part/I/chapter/II/crossheading/the-tenants-notice"> The tenant’s notice</a></p><ol><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1993/28/section/42">42.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1993/28/section/42">Notice by qualifying tenant of claim to exercise right.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1993/28/section/43">43.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1993/28/section/43"> General provisions as respects effect of tenant’s notice.</a></span></p></li></ol></li><li class="LegClearFix LegContentsPblock"><p class="LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1993/28/part/I/chapter/II/crossheading/procedure-following-giving-of-tenants-notice"> Procedure following giving of tenant’s notice</a></p><ol><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1993/28/section/44">44.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1993/28/section/44"> Access by landlords for valuation purposes.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1993/28/section/45">45.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1993/28/section/45"> Landlord’s counter-notice.</a></span></p></li></ol></li><li class="LegClearFix LegContentsPblock"><p class="LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1993/28/part/I/chapter/II/crossheading/applications-to-court-or-leasehold-valuation-tribunal"> Applications